<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>It seems Thou art in heaven hearing me,</l><l>But right within my spirit Thou dost dwell;</l><l>It seems that I am praying unto Thee,</l><l>But really from Thyself the prayers do well.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When, Lord, no words my burden can express,</l><l>My spirit with Thy Spirit deeply groans;</l><l>Not verbally I then my plea address,</l><l>But Thou dost pray within with words unknown.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I would inhale Thee, Lord, e’en as I breathe,</l><l>And eat and drink Thee as my life supply.</l><l>A deeper fellowship with Thee bequeath</l><l>That Thou express Thyself through me thereby.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Here in this fellowship Thy light doth shine,</l><l>Thy precious blood doth cleanse and make me clean;</l><l>May I not only, Lord, Thy light enshrine,</l><l>But may Thou be expressed and clearly seen.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Thy oil anoints me here in every way,</l><l>Anointing Thee within unceasingly;</l><l>I more decrease, Thou more increase each day,</l><l>Thus full expression Thou shalt have through me.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Myself I open that Thou may flow in;</l><l>Op’ning myself to others, Lord, flow out;</l><l>By such a stream, the fellowship within,</l><l>Thou, Lord, expressed will be my life throughout.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
